2\"></span><span class=\"inline-block\">Strategy &amp; Business Structuring</span></span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"md:hidden\"><ul><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/\">Introduction</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/get-started\">Get Started</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Become%20a%20brand%20strategist\">Become a Brand Strategist</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Business%20development\">Business Development</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Events%20and%20Networking\">Events and Networking</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Hire%20an%20Expert\">Hire an Expert</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Join%20Our%20Discord%20Server\">Join Our Discord Server</a></li><li class=\"active\"><button>Our Story</button><div style=\"display:initial\"><ul><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Our%20Story/What%20we%20offer\">What we offer</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Our%20Story/How%20We%20Work\">How We Work</a></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/Productivity\">Productivity</a></li><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/Solutions\">Solutions</a><ul><li><a href=\"#business-systems--platforms\" class=\"active-anchor\"><span class=\"flex text-sm\"><span class=\"opacity-25\">#</span><span class=\"mr-2\"></span><span class=\"inline-block\">Business Systems &amp; Platforms</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"#strategy--business-structuring\" class=\"\"><span class=\"flex text-sm\"><span class=\"opacity-25\">#</span><span class=\"mr-2\"></span><span class=\"inline-block\">Strategy &amp; Business Structuring</span></span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div></div></aside><div id=\"reach-skip-nav\" data-reach-skip-nav-content=\"\"></div><article class=\"docs-container relative pt-20 pb-16 px-6 md:px-8 w-full max-w-full overflow-x-hidden\"><main class=\"max-w-screen-md mx-auto\"><h1>Real Projects. Real Work. Real Outcomes.</h1><p>Business Hustle is not a theory-driven consultancy - we are a delivery-first business developmement partner. Over the years, we've worked across wellness, technology, creative industries, NPOs, and small businesses to help founders turn ideas into structured, operational, and revenue-capable ventures.</p><p>Below is a curated showcase of projects, platforms, and initiatives developed or supported by Business Hustle.</p><h1>Hustle Basics A Quick Guide to Business</h1><div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%\"><img style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27384%27%20height=%27216%27/%3e\"></span><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: auto; display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; max-height: 100%;\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\"><noscript><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHb-img.971ae693.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%\" loading=\"lazy\"/></noscript></span></div>\n<div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:4rem 2.5rem;text-align:center\"><p><strong>This book is meant to guide the entrepreneur through dynamic complex business situations experienced during the start-up phase of your organization.</strong></p></div></div><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://app.businesshustle.co.za/product/hustle-basics-ebook/\">Hustle Basics</a> — Hustle Basics is the essential entry-level toolkit for entrepreneurs, freelancers, and small business owners. Designed to turn overwhelm into clarity, ideas into action, and uncertainty into momentum — simply, effectively, and affordably.</p><p><strong>This is for you if you’re:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Launching your first business or side hustle</p></li><li><p>Feeling stuck or unsure about your next move</p></li><li><p>Seeking a clear foundation before investing further</p></li></ul><p><strong>What’s included:</strong></p><p>✅ Clarity Frameworks – Define your vision, purpose, and direction</p><p>✅ Foundational Planning Tools – Map out your path from idea to execution</p><p>✅ Essential Strategy &amp; Systems – Build a solid base to scale confidently</p><p>✅ Action-Oriented Resources – Self-paced, practical, and designed to deliver results</p><p>📌 Where successful hustles begin.\nStart building the right way — with structure, clarity, and momentum.</p><h2><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"business-systems--platforms\"></span><a href=\"#business-systems--platforms\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">Business Systems &amp; Platforms<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h2><h3><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"business-hustle-project-manager\"></span><a href=\"#business-hustle-project-manager\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">Business Hustle Project Manager<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h3><div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%\"><img style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27384%27%20height=%27216%27/%3e\"></span><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: auto; display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; max-height: 100%;\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\"><noscript><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbhpm.5994ca25.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%\" loading=\"lazy\"/></noscript></span></div><p>At the core of Business Hustle is our project management and execution platform — the system we use to plan, track, and deliver real business work.</p><p>This is not generic project management software.\nIt is a business execution system built around how entrepreneurs and small teams actually operate.</p><p><strong>The platform helps you:</strong></p><p>✅ Structure your business initiatives into clear projects</p><p>✅ Break strategy into actionable tasks</p><p>✅ Track progress across teams and collaborators</p><p>✅ Maintain accountability and momentum</p><p>✅ Move from planning to execution — consistently</p><p>Whether you’re building a startup, running a programme, or managing multiple initiatives, this PM tool provides clarity and control. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://app.businesshustle.co.za/product/ultimate-project-management-solution/\">Access Business Hustle Project Management App</a></p><h3><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"hustleportal\"></span><a href=\"#hustleportal\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">HustlePortal™<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h3><div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%\"><img style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%271920%27%20height=%271080%27/%3e\"></span><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: auto; display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; max-height: 100%;\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\"><noscript><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhustleportal.85c4f1cc.gif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%\" loading=\"lazy\"/></noscript></span></div><p>HustlePortal is Business Hustle’s entry-level digital launch solution — built specifically for entrepreneurs, startups, and small businesses in South Africa who need a credible online presence without breaking the bank.</p><p>For only R1,850/year, you get a professionally designed, SEO-ready landing page that turns visitors into enquiries and customers.</p><p><strong>Who it's for:</strong> Startups, SME's, entrepreneurs without a website.</p><p><strong>Problem</strong>: You're losing credibility and customers because you're not online.\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://hustleportal.online/business-hustle\">Launch Your Business Online — Fast, Affordable, Professional</a></p><h3><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"bh-local---a-business-hustle-project\"></span><a href=\"#bh-local---a-business-hustle-project\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">BH LOCAL - A Business Hustle Project<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h3><div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%\"><img style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%271920%27%20height=%271080%27/%3e\"></span><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: auto; display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; max-height: 100%;\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\"><noscript><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FBHLocal.825b4025.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%\" loading=\"lazy\"/></noscript></span></div><p>BH Local is Business Hustle’s newest initiative designed to champion, elevate and digitally empower neighbourhoods, streets and business districts across South Africa.</p><p>We transform iconic local areas into curated digital destinations — boosting visibility, foot traffic, and brand discovery for the businesses that bring a neighbourhood to life.</p><p>Our first flagship project:</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://kloofstreet.online/welcome\">KloofStreet.online</a> <div class=\"bleed relative mt-6 -mx-6 md:-mx-8 2xl:-mx-24\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: initial; height: initial; background: none; opacity: 1; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; width: initial; height: initial; background: none; opacity: 1; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%271920%27%20height=%271080%27/%3e\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; width: initial; height: initial; background: none; opacity: 1; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span><img alt=\"Nextra Example\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FKloofstreet.onlinemap.dbce32aa.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"intrinsic\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FKloofstreet.onlinemap.dbce32aa.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FKloofstreet.onlinemap.dbce32aa.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: auto; display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; max-height: 100%; filter: blur(20px); background-size: cover; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAAFCAMAAABPT11nAAAAHlBMVEX7/v9jYF/w+v7s7/L39vecmJjk6vOgnJxlZmePjIy4sOwDAAAACXBIWXMAAA7EAAAOxAGVKw4bAAAAKElEQVR4nCXByQHAIAwEsWEPm/TfcB5IzIwlCTmA4DyX7bb7FRKC/QMKcgB8QeifiQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==&quot;); background-position: 0% 0%;\"><noscript></noscript></span></div></p><p><strong>The digital heart of Cape Town’s most vibrant street.</strong></p><h2><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"strategy--business-structuring\"></span><a href=\"#strategy--business-structuring\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">Strategy &amp; Business Structuring<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h2><h3><span class=\"subheading-anchor\" id=\"turning-ideas-into-viable-structured-businesses\"></span><a href=\"#turning-ideas-into-viable-structured-businesses\" class=\"text-current no-underline no-outline\">Turning Ideas Into Viable, Structured Businesses<span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a></h3><p>We help founders move from ideas and vision to clear business models, strategies, and operational structure.</p><p><strong>This solution is ideal for:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Startups and early-stage businesses</p></li><li><p>Founders refining direction or business models</p></li><li><p>Organisations preparing for growth or funding</p></li></ul><p><strong>What we typically deliver:</strong></p><p>✅ Business strategy and planning</p><p>✅ Service and offer structuring</p><p>✅ Business model refinement</p><p>✅ Governance and operational frameworks</p><p>Seen in projects like:\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ubuntuwellness.com\">Ubuntu Wellness</a> · <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.drkoketsorakhudu.com/\">Office of Dr Koketso Rakhudu</a> · <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://gabonewe.co.za/consult\">Gabonewe Projects</a> · <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ikmgs.co.za/\">Institute of Kemetic &amp; Marcus Garvey Studies</a></p><p>👉 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://app.businesshustle.co.za/product-category/web-development-hosting/\">Explore Strategy Solutions</a></p><footer class=\"mt-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-row items-center justify-between\"><div><a class=\"text-lg font-medium p-4 -m-4 no-underline text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 flex items-center mr-2\" title=\"Productivity\" href=\"/Productivity\"><svg height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"transform inline flex-shrink-0 rotate-180 mr-1\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg>Productivity</a></div><div></div></div><hr><div class=\"mt-24 flex justify-between flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center md:items-end\"><span class=\"text-gray-600\">Business Hustle <!-- -->2026<!-- --> © Simple eternity holdings (Pty) Ltd.</span><div class=\"mt-6\"></div><a class=\"text-sm\" href=\"https://github.com/JacobSeatlholo/businesshustle-/blob/main/pages/Solutions.mdx\" target=\"_blank\">Contribute to this page</a></div></footer></main></article></div></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{}},\"page\":\"/Solutions\",\"query\":{},\"buildId\":\"JHbDnKCiM2BtvtkE2Ags2\",\"nextExport\":true,\"autoExport\":true,\"isFallback\":false,\"scriptLoader\":[]}</script><script src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-786327701\" data-nscript=\"afterInteractive\"></script><script id=\"gtag-init\" data-nscript=\"afterInteractive\">\n            window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n            function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n            gtag('js', new Date());\n            gtag('config', 'AW-786327701');\n          </script><next-route-announcer><p aria-live=\"assertive\" id=\"__n